join Lizzy right [animation="Fade In Up"]
[background scene="res://Scenes/Cutscenes/basement noahs machine.tscn" fade="0.5"]
join Barb (Animated) left [animation="Fade In Up"]
Barb: Um, what the hell is this?
join Item center
Lizzy: It looks like… a piece of glittery beef jerky.
VO: Now I’m hungry.
leave Item
Barb: Oooh my god. It's part of one of Noah's contraptions.

Lizzy: "contraptions"?
Barb (Animated): You know him and his whacky inventions or whatever. He was probably planning something to ruin grad.
Lizzy: What does the beef jerky have to do with anything?
Barb: It’s not beef jerky, Lizzy. Ugh, you’re such a dog.
Lizzy: Hey!
Barb: It looks like the sorry remains of a ....... belt.
Barb: The structural integrity of faux leather is weaker compared to the high quality of genuine leather.
Barb: but he must’ve cheaped out. Just goes to show that the real thing is worth the money.
VO: to stop his machine from breaking... he just needs a higher quality belt.
VO: I’ve got like a million of those.
Lizzy: good work, Barb. You should be a private detective.
Barb: I’d rather die, thanks.
Lizzy: ...
Barb: I mean, yeah, maybe. Could be fun.
Lizzy: ...
Lizzy: how is that worse?
Barb: Well, what do we do now?
Lizzy: I guess we wait for the next loop so I can tell Noah his machine is going to break. Then he’ll believe me.
update Barb [animation="Bounce" length="0.3" repeat="2"]
Barb: No! Don’t fix it!
Barb: He wants to ruin graduation with it!
Lizzy: Sorry, Barb, but this thing’s bigger than graduation.
Barb: It’s fine, I can just sabotage it later.
Lizzy: Just do it after I convince him, okay?
Barb: No promises.
[background arg="res://assets/to be continued.png" fade="2.0"]
leave --All-- [animation="Fade Out" length="2.0"]
[wait time="1.0"]
Lizzy: wait what the hell--
[wait time="2.0"]
[background arg="#000000ff" fade="1.5" wait="true"]
set {Interaction} = 4.0
do GameState.make_item_collectible("belt")
do GameState.next_day()
jump rewind/